OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785341919
OL,3,CHeathrow passengers face higher fares
OL,4,Cas airport can recover expansion costs
OL,6,FHeathrow passengers face decades of
OL,7,Fhigher fares after the airport was
OL,8,Fgiven permission to recover early
OL,9,Fcosts from developing its expansion
OL,10,Fplan.
OL,12,FRegulator the Civil Aviation Authority
OL,13,F(CAA) announced it has permitted
OL,14,FHeathrow Airport Limited (HAL) to
OL,15,Frecoup #320 million spent on its
OL,16,Fproposal to build a third runway since
OL,17,Fthe start of last year.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
