FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785341919
OL,3,CHeathrow passengers face higher fares
OL,4,Cas airport can recover expansion costs
OL,6,FIt will recover the money through
OL,7,Fhigher airline charges, which are
OL,8,Ftypically passed on to passengers in
OL,9,Fair fares, for about 20-25 years.
OL,11,FHeathrow West, a rival expansion
OL,12,Fscheme led by property billionaire
OL,13,FSurinder Arora, has been given the go-
OL,14,Fahead to recoup #4.1 million it spent
OL,15,Fon its plan in 2025 up to November 25,
OL,16,Fwhen the Government announced HAL's
OL,17,Fproposal was its preferred option.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785341919
OL,3,CHeathrow passengers face higher fares
OL,4,Cas airport can recover expansion costs
OL,6,FThe CAA said its decision will
OL,7,Fincrease the maximum airport charge
OL,8,Fper passenger by about 15p in 2028,
OL,9,Frising to an estimated 30p in
OL,10,Fsubsequent years.
OL,12,FBritish Airways, the largest airline
OL,13,Fat Heathrow, warned that early cost
OL,14,Frecovery by HAL would create a risk
OL,15,Fthat expansion will be "unaffordable
OL,16,Ffor consumers and inconsistent with a
OL,17,Fcredible benefits case", according to
OL,18,Fa CAA document.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785341919
OL,3,CHeathrow passengers face higher fares
OL,4,Cas airport can recover expansion costs
OL,6,FAirlines have repeatedly complained
OL,7,Fthat Heathrow has the highest charges
OL,8,Fof any airport in the world.
OL,10,FThe money that can be recovered
OL,11,Fincludes the planning and design costs
OL,12,Fnecessary to develop a credible
OL,13,Fexpansion proposal, including
OL,14,Fpreparing material to support a future
OL,15,Fdevelopment consent order (DCO)
OL,16,Fapplication.
OL,18,FDCOs grant permission for major
OL,19,Finfrastructure projects to go-ahead.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785341919
OL,3,CHeathrow passengers face higher fares
OL,4,Cas airport can recover expansion costs
OL,6,FTim Johnson, the CAA's director of
OL,7,Fconsumers and markets, said: "Our
OL,8,Fdecision strikes a balance between
OL,9,Fsupporting the delivery of benefits to
OL,10,Fconsumers through timely progress on
OL,11,FHeathrow expansion, whilst also
OL,12,Fprotecting them from undue increases
OL,13,Fin costs.
OL,15,F"The costs Heathrow can recover are
OL,16,Fcapped, independently scrutinised and
OL,17,Fsubject to efficiency reviews, helping
OL,18,Fensure that passengers only pay for
OL,19,Fefficient costs that are justified."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785341919
OL,3,CHeathrow passengers face higher fares
OL,4,Cas airport can recover expansion costs
OL,6,FA separate process will be conducted
OL,7,Fto decide arrangements for costs
OL,8,Fincurred from 2027.
OL,10,FLast month, the Government launched a
OL,11,Fconsultation on its Heathrow expansion
OL,12,Fnational policy statement, setting out
OL,13,Fthe conditions needed if the project
OL,14,Fis to be given the go-ahead.
OL,16,FFormer chancellor Rachel Reeves said
OL,17,Fshe was determined to get "spades in
OL,18,Fthe ground" for the third runway in
OL,19,Fthe current Parliament, and for it to
OL,20,Fbe built by 2035.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
