PN,38607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785341919
OL,3,CHeathrow passengers face higher fares
OL,4,Cas airport can recover expansion costs
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham, who
OL,7,Fsacked Ms Reeves, has previously
OL,8,Fexpressed concerns over Heathrow
OL,9,Fexpansion, stating the plans divert
OL,10,Finfrastructure investment "away from
OL,11,Fthe North and traps it in London".
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
